170
00:11:52,51 --> 00:11:56,53
You're young. You're weird. Chicks dig that.
你年輕，你古怪 女生最喜歡了

171
00:11:56,81 --> 00:12:01,01
Isn't sex better when it's with one person that you really care about?
跟一個你很喜歡的人做 感覺不是更棒？

172
00:12:01,55 --> 00:12:03,61
Yeah,in a poem,maybe.
在詩裡吧

173
00:12:04,72 --> 00:12:08,18
No,the man's right. That's what I had with Rachel.
不，他說得對 我跟瑞秋就是那樣

174
00:12:08,39 --> 00:12:09,72
Not anymore?
現在沒有了？

175
00:12:10,06 --> 00:12:14,05
No. I slept with someone else.
沒了，我跟別人上了床

176
00:12:14,30 --> 00:12:17,39
So wait. So how did that make things better?
等等，那樣對事情有幫助嗎？

177
00:12:19,00 --> 00:12:20,47
It didn't.
沒有

178
00:12:22,17 --> 00:12:25,50
What you used to have with Rachel is what I got with Alice.
你跟瑞秋的感覺 就是我和愛麗絲的感覺

179
00:12:25,71 --> 00:12:27,30
Now,what is that like?
那是什麼感覺？

180
00:12:27,54 --> 00:12:28,87
It's so cool,man.
很棒的感覺

181
00:12:29,14 --> 00:12:33,51
It's because being with her is so much better than not being with her.
因為跟她在一起 比不跟她在一起快樂多了

182
00:12:35,15 --> 00:12:38,21
-Why can't I find that? -I had it and I blew it.
我為什麼找不到？ 我擁有過，卻搞砸了

183
00:12:38,42 --> 00:12:39,82
Well,I want it!
我想要！

184
00:12:40,05 --> 00:12:40,99
You can have it.
你一定可以擁有

185
00:12:41,22 --> 00:12:43,75
Maybe there's something wrong with me.
也許我有毛病

186
00:12:44,09 --> 00:12:47,86
No,it's out there,man. I've seen it! I got it!
你會找到的 我見過，也擁有了

187
00:12:48,90 --> 00:12:51,52
-Then,you hold on to it! -All right,man!
那你就要好好把握 好

188
00:12:51,77 --> 00:12:54,43
All right! Congratulations, you lucky bastard!
死小子，恭喜你

189
00:12:55,10 --> 00:12:56,83
You're Frank's best man?
你是法蘭克的伴郎？

190
00:12:59,37 --> 00:13:01,93
I couldn't help it. Their love is so pure.
我沒辦法，他們的愛好純潔

191
00:13:03,11 --> 00:13:05,10
What about you,huh?
那你呢？

192
00:13:05,75 --> 00:13:07,08
I'm the ring bearer.
我幫他拿戒指

193
00:13:26,20 --> 00:13:30,19
I'm so glad you could come. I've got a real home-ec emergency.
你來了就好 我有一個家政慘案

194
00:13:30,40 --> 00:13:33,13
Oh,my God. Who died on this?
天哪，誰死了？

195
00:13:33,74 --> 00:13:35,54
It's a real "mustard-tastrophe."
芥末醬倒了

196
00:13:37,11 --> 00:13:37,91
Can you help?
你有辦法嗎？

197
00:13:38,31 --> 00:13:42,31
Absolutely. First,we'll start with a little club soda and salt.
當然有，先用蘇打水加鹽清洗

198
00:13:42,62 --> 00:13:45,64
-Then if that doesn't work -Forget it. It's ruined.
要是洗不掉，就… 算了，它已經毀了

199
00:13:45,92 --> 00:13:49,58
Never say that. If you can't get it out,cut around the stain...
別這麼說，要是洗不掉 就剪掉髒污部份

200
00:13:49,89 --> 00:13:53,26
...add a little lace, you make a stylish throw.
縫一點蕾絲 就是一條漂亮的遮布

201
00:13:54,23 --> 00:13:57,63
Or instead,maybe you could just not marry my brother,Frank?
又或者，你可以 不要嫁給我弟弟

202
00:14:02,57 --> 00:14:05,60
Can we make it smaller? Make it fit on the head of a pin?
能不能讓它小到 可以放在針尖上？

203
00:14:05,81 --> 00:14:08,80
I love when we make things fit on the head of a pin.
我喜歡生產這種小東西

204
00:14:10,95 --> 00:14:12,78
You have Monica Geller here.
摩妮卡蓋勒來訪

205
00:14:12,98 --> 00:14:15,01
Absolutely. Yeah,send her in.
好的，讓她進來

206
00:14:18,79 --> 00:14:20,34
What the hell is this?
這是什麼意思？

207
00:14:20,75 --> 00:14:23,52
Hang on for a sec. I'll talk to you in the morning?
等一下…明天早上再談？

208
00:14:23,76 --> 00:14:24,59
You got it.
好的

209
00:14:25,93 --> 00:14:27,15
I'm sorry. What?
對不起，什麼？

210
00:14:27,43 --> 00:14:28,86
What's this supposed to mean?
這是什麼意思？

211
00:14:29,10 --> 00:14:32,29
Well,you know, I never know how much to tip.
我一直不會算小費

212
00:14:34,10 --> 00:14:37,37
You double the tax. Not double the tax of Romania.
把加稅乘以二 不是把羅馬尼亞的稅收乘以二

213
00:14:39,64 --> 00:14:43,44
Are you buying me? Is this how you get girls to go out with you?
你要買我嗎？ 你都這樣約女孩子？

214
00:14:43,68 --> 00:14:45,98
I'm still here.
我還在

215
00:14:49,05 --> 00:14:52,14
You're taking this wrong. If I didn't leave you that tip...
你誤會了 要是我沒給這筆小費

216
00:14:52,35 --> 00:14:55,62
...you wouldn't have come, we wouldn't have this argument...
你就不會來，我們不會爭吵

217
00:14:55,86 --> 00:14:58,38
...and there wouldn't be this heat between us.
也不會有這種緊張的氣氛

218
00:14:59,46 --> 00:15:03,90
You gotta admit that our relationship is hitting a new level now.
你得承認我們的關係有進展了

219
00:15:04,13 --> 00:15:06,57
You were the chef and I was the customer.
以前你是廚師，我是顧客

220
00:15:06,83 --> 00:15:08,89
But now we're this couple that fights.
現在我們是兩個爭吵的人

221
00:15:11,64 --> 00:15:13,00
You're a loon.
你是個瘋子

222
00:15:13,91 --> 00:15:17,84
Look,forget the check,okay? I like you.
別管這張支票了，我喜歡你

223
00:15:18,08 --> 00:15:20,07
I think you're great.
我覺得你很棒

224
00:15:20,98 --> 00:15:22,41
Come on,what do you say?
怎麼樣？

225
00:15:25,09 --> 00:15:26,38
I don't know.
我不知道

226
00:15:26,69 --> 00:15:27,92
Why not?
為什麼？

227
00:15:28,92 --> 00:15:31,32
I don't wanna encourage this behavior.
我不想鼓勵這種行為

228
00:15:32,56 --> 00:15:36,43
One meal. That's all I'm asking for. Please?
我只求一頓飯，好嗎？

229
00:15:37,03 --> 00:15:38,43
We go out,we eat.
我們出去吃飯

230
00:15:38,70 --> 00:15:42,33
If you don't have a good time, I'll give you 10 grand,we're even.
要是玩得不開心 我給你一萬，我們扯平

231
00:15:55,35 --> 00:15:58,28
Wait,no. Just put the mail down. It's me.
不，把信放下，是我

232
00:15:59,69 --> 00:16:02,88
Sorry. Why were you just all in the dark?
對不起，你怎麼不開燈？

233
00:16:03,12 --> 00:16:08,12
Your laundry smelled so good that I thought I'd curl up in it.
你的衣服好香，我就窩在裡面

234
00:16:08,53 --> 00:16:10,43
-ls that all right? -Yeah,sure.
沒關係吧？ 沒關係

235
00:16:10,73 --> 00:16:12,06
So how was your day?
今天過得怎樣？

236
00:16:12,30 --> 00:16:16,20
It's just probably the worst one since I've been alive.
可能是我有生以來最慘的一天

237
00:16:19,31 --> 00:16:20,97
What happened?
怎麼了？

238
00:16:21,71 --> 00:16:25,20
Alice.... She called it off.
愛麗絲改變心意了

239
00:16:29,38 --> 00:16:31,87
Did she say why?
她有說原因嗎？

240
00:16:32,55 --> 00:16:34,54
No. Just that I was too young.
沒有，她只說我太年輕

241
00:16:34,79 --> 00:16:37,45
I don't see how I could suddenly be too young...
我怎麼突然變年輕了？

242
00:16:37,66 --> 00:16:41,25
... because I'm older than I was when we first got together.
剛交往時，她還說我老成

243
00:16:45,40 --> 00:16:50,27
I don't know. But you know what? Maybe it's just all for the best.
不曉得，但是你知道嗎？ 或許這樣也好

244
00:16:50,47 --> 00:16:54,00
Well,yeah,if the best is like unbelievable pain.
是啊，但是我好痛苦

245
00:16:54,58 --> 00:16:56,30
Oh,sweetie.
親愛的

246
00:16:56,94 --> 00:16:59,81
You know,I was just finally happy.
我好不容易感到快樂

247
00:17:00,15 --> 00:17:02,74
For the first time in my life...
這是生平第一次

248
00:17:03,28 --> 00:17:05,27
...after my dad left me...
先是爸爸離開我…

249
00:17:05,49 --> 00:17:10,62
...and then getting arrested for stealing those birds...
然後偷鳥被逮捕…

250
00:17:10,99 --> 00:17:14,59
...and then the whole punctured-lung thing.
然後又肺穿孔

251
00:17:15,93 --> 00:17:19,42
It's still really hard to take deep breaths in cold weather...
天氣一冷，我還是很難深呼吸

252
00:17:19,63 --> 00:17:23,59
...but with Alice, all that stuff kind of went away.
但是有了愛麗絲 這些都不見了

253
00:17:24,84 --> 00:17:29,21
And now it's gone, and I don't know why.
現在我失去了，卻不知道原因

254
00:17:31,31 --> 00:17:34,80
Well,I can tell you why. It's because of me.
我可以告訴你，是我害的

255
00:17:36,12 --> 00:17:39,55
But you know what? I only did it because I love you,okay?
不過我是愛你才這麼做

256
00:17:41,82 --> 00:17:42,62
What?
什麼？

257
00:17:42,86 --> 00:17:45,69
I kind of had a little chat with Alice...
我跟愛麗絲聊了一下

258
00:17:45,96 --> 00:17:49,79
...and I sort of made her see why you two shouldn't be together.
讓她明白你們為何不能在一起

259
00:17:50,00 --> 00:17:53,19
And you'll see it too,one day. You really,really will.
你總有一天也會明白，真的

260
00:17:53,47 --> 00:17:55,96
Wait a minute. This is because of you?
等一下，是你造成的？

261
00:17:57,81 --> 00:18:00,47
My mother didn't want us to be together...
我媽反對我們在一起

262
00:18:00,67 --> 00:18:03,58
...but the worst thing she did was tie me to the porch.
但是她頂多把我綁在門廊上

263
00:18:06,05 --> 00:18:09,64
I came to you because I thought you'd understand.
我覺得你能瞭解，所以來找你

264
00:18:14,72 --> 00:18:16,75
I would storm out of here...
我很想摔門走人

265
00:18:16,99 --> 00:18:20,39
...if I had some money or a place to go.
但是我沒錢、沒地方去

266
00:18:26,87 --> 00:18:28,93
Oh,my God! The millionaire's here!
天哪，大富豪來了

267
00:18:29,20 --> 00:18:30,73
Oh,my God!
天哪

268
00:18:36,11 --> 00:18:38,58
I'm just gonna have dinner with him.
我只是要跟他吃頓飯

269
00:18:38,85 --> 00:18:43,41
Okay,just because he buys you dinner does not mean you owe him anything.
他請你吃飯 並不代表你欠他什麼

270
00:18:45,25 --> 00:18:46,18
I know.
我知道

271
00:18:47,42 --> 00:18:49,55
Okay,then get the lobster.
那記得點龍蝦

272
00:18:58,47 --> 00:19:01,06
How much cash you got in your pocket now?
你口袋裡有多少現金？

273
00:19:03,77 --> 00:19:07,04
And that's why I'm not inviting you in for a drink.
我就不請你進來坐了

274
00:19:07,64 --> 00:19:09,87
Why not? Hey,come in for drink.
進來坐一下嘛

275
00:19:11,41 --> 00:19:13,88
-Where do you wanna go? -You like pizza?
你想去哪裡？ 喜歡吃披薩嗎？

276
00:19:14,15 --> 00:19:17,08
-That sounds great. -I know a great little place.
聽起來不錯 有一家館子不錯

277
00:19:23,29 --> 00:19:25,26
You're not paying for the pizza.
我不能讓你付錢

278
00:19:25,49 --> 00:19:28,66
Come on,it's only fair. You paid for the flight.
這樣很公平，你出了機票錢

279
00:19:29,73 --> 00:19:30,79
Is that enough lira?
這些里拉夠嗎？

280
00:19:31,47 --> 00:19:33,26
I'd throw another 1000 on that.
再丟個一千

281
00:19:33,90 --> 00:19:36,34
-How much is that? -That's about 60 cents.
這樣是多少？ 大約60毛美金

282
00:19:47,85 --> 00:19:49,78
Every night!
每天晚上都這樣

283
00:19:51,75 --> 00:19:53,95
You don't need to smoke.
你不需要抽煙

284
00:19:54,15 --> 00:19:56,75
Cigarettes don't control you.
香煙不能控制你

285
00:19:57,02 --> 00:20:00,43
You are a strong,confident woman...
你是堅強、有自信的女性

286
00:20:00,96 --> 00:20:03,33
... who does not need to smoke.
你不需要抽煙

287
00:20:03,70 --> 00:20:06,79
A strong,confident woman...
堅強、有自信的女性

288
00:20:07,10 --> 00:20:09,76
... who does not need to smoke.
不需要抽煙

289
00:20:21,95 --> 00:20:25,72
Look,I know that you think I did this totally evil thing.
我知道你覺得我做了大壞事

290
00:20:25,99 --> 00:20:27,48
But I so didn't.
但是我沒有

291
00:20:28,52 --> 00:20:31,69
Someone's here who can explain this better than I can.
有一個人可以解釋得比我清楚

292
00:20:43,57 --> 00:20:45,33
Hi,Mrs. IKnight.
奈特老師

293
00:20:47,81 --> 00:20:49,83
Phoebe's right,Frank.
法蘭克，菲比說得對

294
00:20:50,58 --> 00:20:54,41
It's hard to hear,but it would've been wrong to go through with it.
這話不中聽，但我們不該結婚

295
00:20:54,65 --> 00:20:56,31
I was being selfish.
我太自私了

296
00:20:56,52 --> 00:21:00,32
Even though we want the same things right now...
我們現在追求相同的東西

297
00:21:00,55 --> 00:21:03,39
...in the future,we may not.
未來卻不見得如此

298
00:21:04,52 --> 00:21:07,02
-ls that what it is? -Yes,but not just that.
對不對？ 對，但不只如此

299
00:21:07,26 --> 00:21:08,56
Not just that.
不只如此

300
00:21:12,23 --> 00:21:17,36
Even though we love each other as much as we do...
雖然我們現在非常相愛

301
00:21:18,27 --> 00:21:19,71
... nonetheless....
然而…

302
00:21:22,11 --> 00:21:23,60
Nonetheless.
然而…

303
00:21:29,02 --> 00:21:31,28
You're too young...
你還年輕…

304
00:21:31,79 --> 00:21:35,08
...to really know what you want.
不曉得你要什麼

305
00:21:35,36 --> 00:21:37,29
That's right,exactly.
沒錯

306
00:21:39,63 --> 00:21:41,69
That's a goodbye kiss. That's good.
你們在吻別，很好

307
00:21:44,06 --> 00:21:45,46
Bye-bye.
再見

308
00:21:46,57 --> 00:21:50,90
The important thing is, is that you see what I'm saying.
總之希望你瞭解我的意思

309
00:21:51,61 --> 00:21:53,87
This is clearly wrong.
這麼做擺明是錯的

310
00:21:55,38 --> 00:21:57,87
I've decided I'm gonna let this happen.
我絕不會袖手旁觀

311
00:21:59,25 --> 00:22:01,15
Can I just get my purse?
我要拿皮包

312
00:22:01,78 --> 00:22:03,72
Okay,all right,good.
好吧，算了

313
00:22:08,86 --> 00:22:11,19
Cigarettes don't control you.
香煙不能控制你

314
00:22:11,46 --> 00:22:14,45
You are a strong,confident woman...
你是堅強、有自信的女性

315
00:22:14,76 --> 00:22:17,63
... who does not need to smoke.
你不需要抽煙

316
00:22:19,60 --> 00:22:22,76
Joey's your best friend.
喬伊是你最要好的朋友

317
00:22:23,14 --> 00:22:27,44
You wanna make him a cheese sandwich every day.
你要每天為他做起司三明治

318
00:22:29,84 --> 00:22:34,97
And you also wanna buy him hundreds of dollars worth of pants.
你還要送他一條幾百塊的褲子

319
00:00:00,00 --> 00:00:00,00


320
00:00:00,00 --> 00:00:00,00


